<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0e1014" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="VoxSekai — твой мир виртуальной музыки."
    />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/main.css" />
    <script src="/assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="app-shell">
      <%- include('partials/sidebar', { currentPath: '/' }) %>

      <main class="main-area">
        <%- include('partials/topbar', { searchLabel: 'Поиск', showMenuToggle: true }) %>

        <div class="content home-content">
          <div class="page-heading">
            <h1>Твой мир звучит по-новому</h1>
            <p>Главная <span>/</span> Для тебя</p>
          </div>

          <section class="hero-feature" aria-label="Персональная подборка">
            <img
              class="hero-feature-image"
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516280440614-37939bbacd81?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=85"
              alt=""
            />
            <div class="hero-feature-shade"></div>
            <div class="hero-feature-copy">
              <p class="eyebrow"><span>✦</span> ВЫБОР РЕДАКЦИИ · VOXSEKAI</p>
              <p class="hero-feature-kicker">ПЕРСОНАЛЬНАЯ ПОДБОРКА</p>
              <h2>За пределами<br />реального голоса</h2>
              <p class="hero-feature-description">
                Музыка, в которой живут новые миры. Начни с любимого голоса и
                найди звучание, которого ещё не слышал.
              </p>
              <div class="hero-feature-actions">
                <a class="button button-primary" href="/collections">
                  Открыть подборку <span>↗</span>
                </a>
                <span class="hero-feature-meta">24 трека · 1 ч 38 мин</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="hero-feature-count">01 <i></i> 04</span>
          </section>

          <section class="genre-filter" aria-label="Фильтр по жанру">
            <button
              class="genre-chip active"
              type="button"
              data-filter="all"
              aria-pressed="true"
            >
              Все жанры
            </button>
            <button
              class="genre-chip"
              type="button"
              data-filter="j-pop"
              aria-pressed="false"
            >
              J-pop
            </button>
            <button
              class="genre-chip"
              type="button"
              data-filter="electronic"
              aria-pressed="false"
            >
              Электроника
            </button>
            <button
              class="genre-chip"
              type="button"
              data-filter="rock"
              aria-pressed="false"
            >
              Рок
            </button>
            <button
              class="genre-chip"
              type="button"
              data-filter="dance"
              aria-pressed="false"
            >
              Dance
            </button>
            <button
              class="genre-chip"
              type="button"
              data-filter="experimental"
              aria-pressed="false"
            >
              Экспериментальная
            </button>
            <span class="genre-filter-note">Обновлено сегодня</span>
          </section>

          <section class="section-block taste-section">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow muted">ПОДБОРКА ДЛЯ ТЕБЯ</p>
                <h2>Попадание в твой вкус</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">
                  Треки, которые могут стать твоими любимыми
                </p>
              </div>
              <a href="/catalog" class="view-all">
                Все рекомендации <span>↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="taste-layout">
              <div class="track-list" aria-label="Рекомендованные треки">
                <article
                  class="track-card track-row"
                  data-genre="j-pop"
                  data-track-id="world-is-mine"
                  data-track-slug="world-is-mine"
                  data-track-title="World is Mine"
                  data-track-original-title="ワールドイズマイン"
                  data-track-artist="Hatsune Miku"
                  data-track-duration="252"
                  data-track-genre="J-pop"
                  data-track-artwork="artwork-sakura"
                  data-track-glyph="初"
                  data-track-audio=""
                >
                  <div class="mini-cover mini-cover-sakura" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span>初</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="track-row-info">
                    <h3><a href="/track/world-is-mine">ワールドイズマイン</a></h3>
                    <p>ryo (supercell) · Hatsune Miku</p>
                  </div>
                  <span class="track-row-tag">J-pop</span>
                  <span class="track-row-duration">4:12</span>
                  <button
                    class="play-button"
                    data-player-play
                    aria-label="Воспроизвести World is Mine"
                  >
                    ▶
                  </button>
                  <button
                    class="like-button"
                    aria-label="Добавить World is Mine в избранное"
                  >
                    ♡
                  </button>
                </article>
                <article
                  class="track-card track-row"
                  data-genre="electronic"
                  data-track-id="god-ish"
                  data-track-slug="god-ish"
                  data-track-title="God-ish"
                  data-track-original-title="神っぽいな"
                  data-track-artist="Hatsune Miku"
                  data-track-duration="204"
                  data-track-genre="Электроника"
                  data-track-artwork="artwork-night"
                  data-track-glyph="神"
                  data-track-audio=""
                >
                  <div class="mini-cover mini-cover-night" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span>神</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="track-row-info">
                    <h3><a href="/track/god-ish">神っぽいな</a></h3>
                    <p>ピノキオピー · Hatsune Miku</p>
                  </div>
                  <span class="track-row-tag">Электроника</span>
                  <span class="track-row-duration">3:24</span>
                  <button
                    class="play-button"
                    data-player-play
                    aria-label="Воспроизвести God-ish"
                  >
                    ▶
                  </button>
                  <button
                    class="like-button"
                    aria-label="Добавить God-ish в избранное"
                  >
                    ♡
                  </button>
                </article>
                <article
                  class="track-card track-row"
                  data-genre="rock"
                  data-track-id="rolling-girl"
                  data-track-slug="rolling-girl"
                  data-track-title="Rolling Girl"
                  data-track-original-title="ローリンガール"
                  data-track-artist="Hatsune Miku"
                  data-track-duration="196"
                  data-track-genre="Рок"
                  data-track-artwork="artwork-mono"
                  data-track-glyph="転"
                  data-track-audio=""
                >
                  <div class="mini-cover mini-cover-mono" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span>転</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="track-row-info">
                    <h3><a href="/track/rolling-girl">ローリンガール</a></h3>
                    <p>wowaka · Hatsune Miku</p>
                  </div>
                  <span class="track-row-tag">Рок</span>
                  <span class="track-row-duration">3:16</span>
                  <button
                    class="play-button"
                    data-player-play
                    aria-label="Воспроизвести Rolling Girl"
                  >
                    ▶
                  </button>
                  <button
                    class="like-button"
                    aria-label="Добавить Rolling Girl в избранное"
                  >
                    ♡
                  </button>
                </article>
                <article
                  class="track-card track-row"
                  data-genre="dance"
                  data-track-id="worlds-end-dancehall"
                  data-track-slug="worlds-end-dancehall"
                  data-track-title="World's End Dancehall"
                  data-track-original-title="ワールズエンド・ダンスホール"
                  data-track-artist="Hatsune Miku & Megurine Luka"
                  data-track-duration="212"
                  data-track-genre="Dance"
                  data-track-artwork="artwork-peach"
                  data-track-glyph="巡"
                  data-track-audio=""
                >
                  <div class="mini-cover mini-cover-peach" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span>巡</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="track-row-info">
                    <h3><a href="/track/worlds-end-dancehall">ワールズエンド・ダンスホール</a></h3>
                    <p>wowaka · Miku & Luka</p>
                  </div>
                  <span class="track-row-tag">Dance</span>
                  <span class="track-row-duration">3:32</span>
                  <button
                    class="play-button"
                    data-player-play
                    aria-label="Воспроизвести World's End Dancehall"
                  >
                    ▶
                  </button>
                  <button
                    class="like-button"
                    aria-label="Добавить World's End Dancehall в избранное"
                  >
                    ♡
                  </button>
                </article>
              </div>
              <aside class="taste-card" aria-label="Жанр недели">
                <div class="taste-card-heading">
                  <span class="taste-card-mark">≋</span>
                  <span>ТВОЙ ЖАНР НЕДЕЛИ</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Электроника<br />с характером</h3>
                <p>Тебе особенно близко</p>
                <div class="taste-meter">
                  <span style="--level: 86%"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="taste-meter-label">
                  <span>Электроника</span><b>86%</b>
                </div>
                <div class="taste-meter">
                  <span style="--level: 64%"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="taste-meter-label">
                  <span>J-pop</span><b>64%</b>
                </div>
                <div class="taste-meter">
                  <span style="--level: 42%"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="taste-meter-label">
                  <span>Альтернатива</span><b>42%</b>
                </div>
                <a href="/catalog" class="taste-card-link">
                  Найти похожее <span>↗</span>
                </a>
              </aside>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="section-block mood-section">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow muted">СОБРАНО ПО НАСТРОЕНИЮ</p>
                <h2>Под настроение</h2>
              </div>
              <a href="/collections" class="view-all">
                Все подборки <span>↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="mood-grid mood-grid-featured">
              <a
                class="mood-card mood-card-photo mood-night"
                href="/collections"
              >
                <span class="mood-card-kicker">НОЧНОЙ ГОРОД</span>
                <strong>Ночной Токио</strong>
                <small>24 трека · Электроника</small>
              </a>
              <a
                class="mood-card mood-card-photo mood-origin"
                href="/collections"
              >
                <span class="mood-card-kicker">ИСТОКИ</span>
                <strong>С чего всё началось</strong>
                <small>32 трека · Классика</small>
              </a>
              <a
                class="mood-card mood-card-photo mood-energy"
                href="/collections"
              >
                <span class="mood-card-kicker">БОЛЬШЕ ЭНЕРГИИ</span>
                <strong>На максимуме</strong>
                <small>18 треков · Dance</small>
              </a>
              <a
                class="mood-card mood-card-photo mood-quiet"
                href="/collections"
              >
                <span class="mood-card-kicker">ТИШЕ, ЧЕМ ОБЫЧНО</span>
                <strong>Тише, чем обычно</strong>
                <small>21 трек · Ambient</small>
              </a>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="section-block artist-section">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow muted">ГОЛОСА, КОТОРЫЕ ТЫ ЛЮБИШЬ</p>
                <h2>У каждого голоса — свой мир</h2>
              </div>
              <a href="/artists" class="view-all">
                Все исполнители <span>↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="artist-grid artist-grid-featured">
              <a class="artist-card" href="/artist">
                <div class="artist-avatar artist-miku">初</div>
                <div>
                  <h3>Hatsune Miku</h3>
                  <p>Вокалоид · 1 240 треков</p>
                </div>
                <span>↗</span>
              </a>
              <a class="artist-card" href="/artist">
                <div class="artist-avatar artist-rin">鏡</div>
                <div>
                  <h3>Kagamine Rin & Len</h3>
                  <p>Вокалоид · 970 треков</p>
                </div>
                <span>↗</span>
              </a>
              <a class="artist-card" href="/artist">
                <div class="artist-avatar artist-luka">巡</div>
                <div>
                  <h3>Megurine Luka</h3>
                  <p>Вокалоид · 860 треков</p>
                </div>
                <span>↗</span>
              </a>
              <a class="artist-card" href="/artist">
                <div class="artist-avatar artist-kaito">KA</div>
                <div>
                  <h3>KAITO</h3>
                  <p>Вокалоид · 640 треков</p>
                </div>
                <span>↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="home-lower-grid">
            <div class="section-block home-collection-section">
              <div class="section-heading">
                <div>
                  <p class="eyebrow muted">ТВОЯ МУЗЫКА</p>
                  <h2>Твоя коллекция</h2>
                </div>
                <a href="/playlists" class="view-all"
                  >Мои плейлисты <span>↗</span></a
                >
              </div>
              <div class="collection-grid">
                <a
                  class="collection-tile collection-favorites"
                  href="/favorites"
                >
                  <span class="collection-icon">♡</span
                  ><span class="collection-arrow">↗</span>
                  <strong>Самое любимое</strong
                  ><small>24 трека · Твои лайки</small>
                </a>
                <a
                  class="collection-tile collection-repeat"
                  href="/playlist"
                >
                  <span class="collection-icon collection-wave">≋</span
                  ><span class="collection-arrow">↗</span>
                  <strong>На повторе</strong
                  ><small>18 треков · Последний микс</small>
                </a>
              </div>
              <a href="/create-playlist" class="create-collection"
                >＋ Создать новую подборку</a
              >
            </div>
            <div class="section-block event-section">
              <div class="section-heading">
                <div>
                  <p class="eyebrow muted">ВСТРЕЧАЕМСЯ ВЖИВУЮ</p>
                  <h2>За пределами наушников</h2>
                </div>
                <a href="/events" class="view-all"
                  >Все события <span>↗</span></a
                >
              </div>
              <div class="event-list">
                <a class="event-row" href="/events">
                  <span class="event-date"><b>24</b><small>ОКТ</small></span>
                  <span class="event-info"
                    ><strong>Виртуальный мир — Live</strong
                    ><small>Онлайн · Начало в 20:00</small></span
                  >
                  <span class="event-status">СКОРО</span>
                </a>
                <a class="event-row" href="/events">
                  <span class="event-date"><b>31</b><small>ОКТ</small></span>
                  <span class="event-info"
                    ><strong>Vocaloid night: Tokyo</strong
                    ><small>Москва · Начало в 19:30</small></span
                  >
                  <span class="event-status">СКОРО</span>
                </a>
              </div>
              <p class="event-note">
                Добавь событие в календарь, чтобы не пропустить.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>
          <%- include('partials/footer', { footerClass: '', footerText: '© 2026 VoxSekai. Музыка объединяет миры.' }) %>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
    <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <%- include('partials/mobile-nav', { currentPath: '/' }) %>
    <%- include('partials/player') %>
  </body>
</html>
